id: TEST-021
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Test makes real HTTP call
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .test.ts .test.js .spec.ts .spec.js _test.go _test.py
  exclude_paths: .git/ vendor/ node_modules/ e2e/ integration/
  content_contains: fetch
patterns:
  - regex: (fetch|axios|http\.get|requests\.get|http\.Get)\(['"]https?://
    message: "Test makes real HTTP call — use msw, nock, or httptest for deterministic tests"
fix: Mock HTTP calls with msw (browser/node), nock (node), httptest (Go), or responses (Python). Real calls make tests flaky and slow.
